30	/**
31	 * Household identity for owners: two owners belong to the same household when their last name
32	 * (compared case-insensitively, with runs of whitespace collapsed) and postcode match. The
33	 * {@code householdId} is derived deterministically from those two fields, so owners with the
34	 * same last name and postcode share it automatically without any explicit linking. Provides the
35	 * shared lookup and identifier logic reused by the duplicate guard and by the household-size
36	 * queries that key off {@code householdId}.
37	 */
